  <div id="sutta">
  
    <h4 id="thag1.25" class="h1">Thag 1:25  Nandiya (to Māra)</h4>
            <div class="verse">
              <p>Like splendor, his mind,</p>
              <p>continually fruitful:</p>
              <p>Attack a monk like that,</p>
              <p class="v1">you Dark One,</p>
              <p class="v3">and you’ll fall</p>
              <p class="v3">into pain.</p>
            </div><!--end verse-->
            <p class="seealso"> See also: SN 5; <a href="../Ud/ud4_4.html">Ud 4:4</a>; <a href="../StNp/StNp3_2.html">Sn 3:2</a></p><!--end seealso-->
      </div><!--end:sutta-->
    </div><!--end:content-->
    
